			"text": "A flat roof's bitumen membrane for the connected light buildings (structures/buildings, tools/buildings), drawn on the board's axes (the kit JSON's repeat, 12 units): sheets a quarter repeat wide, each lapped over the next, mineral grit, a broad tone drift and pale stains where puddles dried. 512 px. Export: File > Export material > Godot > Godot 4 Standard into data/models/board/textures/structures/buildings (or tools/materials/export.py), then Reload assets in the game's Tuning panel.",
